# Post-battle briefing.
<machine_speech><gray>Battle log — outcome: <shining>{result}<\shining>. Duration {ticks} ticks. Own losses {lost}. Enemy destroyed {killed}. Fleet strength {ships}.<\gray>
?if result = victory
<gray>The middle held. Simple colonizers are predictable: they take the nearest post and rarely defend the one behind it.<\gray>
?else
<gray>Lost the middle. Simple sends waves sized to what it wants to take - it does not need to win every post, only the closest ones.<\gray>
?end
?if lost > 60
<blue>Losses were heavy. Try concentrating before the first contact.<\blue>
?end
